How to Run
1. Clone this repository
2. Open `blinkit_analysis.ipynb` in Google Colab or Jupyter Notebook
3. Upload the CSV files
4. Run cells in order

##Insights & Recommendations
- Blinkit should focus on improving customer sentiment 
  (only 32% positive feedback is a concern)
- 30% delay rate in deliveries needs operational attention
- Dairy & Breakfast and Pharmacy are the strongest categories 
  to focus marketing spend on
- All 4 marketing channels perform similarly — 
  A/B testing different creatives could help identify a winner

